{"id": "check-lightning", "group": "science", "turns": ["歇口气，刚收完展台，我想随便聊点东西。", "打雷和闪电来自同一次放电，为什么人通常先看见闪电？"], "criterion": "光的传播速度远高于声音。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先别急着说，我刚才还盯着展台上的贝壳。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.73, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 199, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 161}}}, {"spoken_text": "先看见闪电，是因为光比声音快。人眼比耳朵快，所以先看到光。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.043, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 231, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
